<div id="header">
<h1>Register Extensions</h1>
</div>
<div id="content">
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Now that we have our extensions ready, we only need to register them.
There are 3 ways to do so, and all of them can combined freely to suit your needs.
Two are manual and one automatic.</p>
</div>
<div class="paragraph">
<p>Also, at any moment, you can clear the configuration using <code>unregisterAllExtensions()</code>:</p>
</div>
<div class="listingblock">
<div class="content">
<pre class="highlight"><code class="language-java" data-lang="java">Asciidoctor asciidoctor = Asciidoctor.Factory.create();
asciidoctor.unregisterAllExtensions();</code></pre>
</div>
</div>
</div>
